# Essor - Revamped - v1.0.0

> A new mod for a fresh start. A new philosophy, a new experience.

- Implemented experience gain for armor : Taking damage ;
- Implemented experience gain for weapons : Inflicting damage and killing entities ;
- Implemented experience gain for tools : Breaking blocks ;
- Added the durability bonus as a reward for levelling up (+1 durability / level) ;
- Added new toast notification to track gained experience and level up.

The changelog is a bit lighter and relaxed, compared to what I usually do. Meh~. *Bisous.*
